-- ANTI DROP (ported from "404 | ANTI DROP"): stops the carried
-- brainrot from being dropped.  It spoofs the velocity the GAME
-- reads/writes on our own HumanoidRootPart by hooking the game
-- metatable.  The hook only applies to non-caller code, so every
-- Nexus movement feature keeps reading/writing real velocity.
-- Wrapped in its own function so its helpers never touch the
-- top-level register count (same trick as the other helper blocks).
